":175052,"en":"The guise of a weather-maker appeared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l022","ordinal":175053,"en":"As though poured from buckets,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l023","ordinal":175054,"en":"Blue-speckled hail spilled from the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l024","ordinal":175055,"en":"Low mist crept down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l025","ordinal":175056,"en":"And then there moved"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l026","ordinal":175057,"en":"A red haze and driving sleet."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l027","ordinal":175058,"en":"All the lowlands filled with rain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l028","ordinal":175059,"en":"All the foothills filled with hail,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l029","ordinal":175060,"en":"Flurries and driving sleet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l030","ordinal":175061,"en":"Clouds gathered overhead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l031","ordinal":175062,"en":"The earth seemed to split,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l032","ordinal":175063,"en":"And God struck the heavens."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l033","ordinal":175064,"en":"The spell of Kakan-Chin"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l034","ordinal":175065,"en":"Poor Kojo then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l035","ordinal":175066,"en":"Stood boldly reciting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l036","ordinal":175067,"en":"His fiery eyes blazed fiercely,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l037","ordinal":175068,"en":"The lion prince Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l038","ordinal":175069,"en":"Truly seized by his bloodlust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b003:l039","ordinal":175070,"en":"Was about to assail Kojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l001","ordinal":175071,"en":"Was about to grapple with him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l002","ordinal":175072,"en":"As he raised Ak-Kelte again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l003","ordinal":175073,"en":"As he was about to shoot Kojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l004","ordinal":175074,"en":"Chynkojo's Black Horse—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l005","ordinal":175075,"en":"That Black Horse, it seems,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l006","ordinal":175076,"en":"Had wings upon its flanks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l007","ordinal":175077,"en":"And, when a wondrous spell was read,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l008","ordinal":175078,"en":"Was accustomed to fly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l009","ordinal":175079,"en":"A mighty sorcerer and magician"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l010","ordinal":175080,"en":"Had fashioned this for Kojo:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l011","ordinal":175081,"en":"Beneath him was his racehorse, the Black Horse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l012","ordinal":175082,"en":"When his precious life was pressed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l013","ordinal":175083,"en":"Whenever it saw an enemy in battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l014","ordinal":175084,"en":"It was accustomed to rise and fly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l015","ordinal":175085,"en":"That Kojo was a master;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l016","ordinal":175086,"en":"Ask not the full extent of his powers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l017","ordinal":175087,"en":"Kojo was a lion aided by spirits."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l018","ordinal":175088,"en":"Resourceful, he went flying,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l019","ordinal":175089,"en":"Kojo was a hero of formidable spirit."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l020","ordinal":175090,"en":"Mingling with the mirage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l021","ordinal":175091,"en":"Chynkojo entered the tumult."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l022","ordinal":175092,"en":"In a deed no son of man would believe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l023","ordinal":175093,"en":"Chynkojo entered the fray."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l024","ordinal":175094,"en":"Much of it is false, much is true;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l025","ordinal":175095,"en":"No one has gone and seen it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l026","ordinal":175096,"en":"And unless manifest God knows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l027","ordinal":175097,"en":"We cannot tell whether it is true."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l028","ordinal":175098,"en":"Half is false and half is true;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l029","ordinal":175099,"en":"Unless the Creator himself knows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l030","ordinal":175100,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l031","ordinal":175101,"en":"Kojo whose deeds were formidable,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l032","ordinal":175102,"en":"Kojo with broad right shoulder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l033","ordinal":175103,"en":"Kojo, a hero surpassing the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1295:b004:l034","ordinal":175104,"en":"Kojo perfect in all twelve limbs,"}]
